    "## 17. Load and validate configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "The validation checks the minimum keys required by downstream notebooks. If PyYAML is unavailable, the starter configuration can still be written as JSON-compatible YAML; loading and structured validation are deferred until PyYAML is installed."
