    "| Primary target | `AQI` |\n",
    "| City identifier | `City` |\n",
    "| Observation date | `Date` |\n",
    "| Forecast horizons | 1–7 days |\n",
    "| Primary model | LightGBM Regressor |\n",
    "| Evaluation | Chronological validation and rolling-origin backtesting |\n",
    "| Visualization output | `images/` |\n",
    "| Generated artifact output | `artifacts/` |\n",
    "| Initial operating mode | Historical replay / backtesting |\n",
    "\n",
    "All notebook-generated charts must be exported to the image area, and generated data/model/report files must be stored in the artifact area. Notebook status messages must not print absolute or unnecessary relative filesystem paths."
