   "source": [
    "## 10. Define the project dependency catalogue\n",
    "\n",
    "Dependencies are grouped by when they are used. The notebook checks the full planned stack, but not every integration package is required to complete environment setup. For example, FastAPI and Streamlit become essential in the application phase, while MLflow is used during model experimentation and tracking.\n",
    "\n",
    "The package check uses installed distribution metadata where available and does not import every library. This keeps the check fast and avoids triggering optional native or GPU integrations."
