    "## 22. Common issues and fixes\n",
    "\n",
    "| Issue | Recommended action |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Python is older than 3.10 | Create a supported virtual environment and select it as the notebook kernel. |\n",
    "| A foundation package is missing | Install the missing package in the active kernel environment, then restart the kernel. |\n",
    "| Package is installed but not detected | Confirm that Jupyter is using the same environment where the package was installed. |\n",
    "| Configuration validation fails | Review the existing configuration manually. This notebook does not overwrite it. |\n",
    "| Cannot write to output areas | Check repository permissions and ensure the project directory is writable. |\n",
    "| Plotly image export fails | Install or repair the compatible Plotly image-export engine; HTML export can be used as an alternative during diagnosis. |\n",
    "| No GPU is detected | Continue with CPU. GPU support is optional for the initial LightGBM workflow. |\n",
    "\n",
    "Do not suppress important exceptions to make a cell appear successful. Correct the underlying environment issue and rerun the affected cell."
